This is a project that will explore different methods that can potentially generate an accurate lineage tree using scLT and scRNAseq data. 

The candidate methods so far:
- Moslin (PMC11492637): a mixed lineage tracing and gene expression approach that will try to link different time point in vivo using the notion of "Distance"
- Carta (https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-025-02903-z): Pure lineage tracing using progenitor prediction and complexity balance approach to link cell lineages.